# CORRECTNESS-E2E-01 F01: Calculus 3 LEFT 5 RIGHT x shows f(x)=53x
# Two adjacent number nodes render as one numeral; the value computed must be
# the value displayed. Assert-only (no screenshot, no golden, no CI wiring).
wait 200
open_app Calculus
wait 60
set_angle_mode rad
key ac
key ac
key f1
key 3
key left
key 5
key right
key x
wait 3
key enter
wait 160
assert_calculus_status ok
assert_calculus_result_exact 53
